        "calls": 1,
        "text": "A scheduled price change takes effect on October 23, 2026, adjusting the cost of three specific AI models for new sessions. You will see warning labels next to these models in the free model list until that date, after which the labels disappear and the new prices apply to any new session you start. Any session already in progress on these models will keep its original cost, so you only notice the difference when you begin a fresh task. This is a preparatory change that sets the rules for the upcoming price shift; the visible warnings and price switches happen automatically at the scheduled time.",
