        "calls": 1,
        "text": "Sites hosting now supports a managed realtime feature that lets connected users see live updates and who else is in a room without needing to set up your own server infrastructure. Developers building websites with the assistant can now prepare their projects to use this feature, and the system provides local testing tools so they can verify everything works before publishing. If you use Freebuff to host websites, you will notice new options to enable room-based communication; otherwise, nothing changes for you today.",
